@startuml
[*] --> InventoryManagement

state InventoryManagement
InventoryManagement : entry / Initial state
InventoryManagement : do / Manage inventory

state AddGoods
AddGoods : entry / Add new goods
AddGoods : do / Enter details of new goods
AddGoods : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry / Update existing item price
UpdatePrice : do / Enter new price
UpdatePrice : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry / Remove goods
RemoveGoods : do / Select goods to remove
RemoveGoods : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state IdentifyExpired
IdentifyExpired : entry / Check for expired goods
IdentifyExpired : do / Notify user of expired goods
IdentifyExpired : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder : entry / Place order to supplier
PlaceOrder : do / Enter order details
PlaceOrder : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state GenerateInvoice
GenerateInvoice : entry / Generate invoice
GenerateInvoice : do / Calculate invoice amount
GenerateInvoice : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state SearchItems
SearchItems : entry / Search for items
SearchItems : do / Enter search criteria
SearchItems : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state CalculateDiscount
CalculateDiscount : entry / Calculate discount and tax
CalculateDiscount : do / Apply discount rules
CalculateDiscount : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt : entry / Generate receipt
GenerateReceipt : do / Print receipt
GenerateReceipt : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state ReplaceItem
ReplaceItem : entry / Replace item
ReplaceItem : do / Select replacement item
ReplaceItem : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state CancelReceipt
CancelReceipt : entry / Cancel receipt
CancelReceipt : do / Void transaction
CancelReceipt : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state RecordRequest
RecordRequest : entry / Record customer request
RecordRequest : do / Enter request details
RecordRequest : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

state ViewReport
ViewReport : entry / View summary report
ViewReport : do / Generate report
ViewReport : exit / Return to InventoryManagement

InventoryManagement --> AddGoods
InventoryManagement --> UpdatePrice
InventoryManagement --> RemoveGoods
InventoryManagement --> IdentifyExpired
InventoryManagement --> PlaceOrder
InventoryManagement --> GenerateInvoice
InventoryManagement --> SearchItems
InventoryManagement --> CalculateDiscount
InventoryManagement --> GenerateReceipt
InventoryManagement --> ReplaceItem
InventoryManagement --> CancelReceipt
InventoryManagement --> RecordRequest
InventoryManagement --> ViewReport

@enduml
